            "review_title": "Review at Trung Tâm Văn Hoá Ẩm Thực 3 Miền",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nOverall, nothing inspires here. You’ll probably wind up here after the museum visit anyways.\nJul 2023 • Solo\nCoffee shop with some food directly opposite of The World Coffee Museum.\n\nOrdering process occurs at a oddly placed kiosk at the front of the restaurant. No table service is available. (-1 point)\n\nYour free drink with entry to the museum is not redeemable here. (Neutral)\n\nBe careful! The terrain of the restaurant is a little bit uneven and difficult to navigate. (Neutral)\n\nIn terms of coffee options, coffee paste (copy paste) like every other coffee shop in Vietnam, maybe the food is good, but I did not try as I was not hungry at the time.\n\nOverall, nothing inspires here. You’ll probably wind up here after the museum visit anyways.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2023",
